# Settings that used to live here now live in this directory's own
# pnpm-workspace.yaml — pnpm 10/11 reads nodeLinker and friends from there,
# and npm emits an "Unknown project config" warning for them if they are left
# in .npmrc. See pnpm-workspace.yaml in this directory for the flat-layout
# and isolation reasoning.
#
# Install this package with a plain `pnpm install` run from this directory.
# The pnpm-workspace.yaml here stops pnpm's upward search, so it no longer
# joins the repository workspace and no --ignore-workspace flag is needed.
# Installing it as part of the root workspace is what leaks React 19 types
# into this React 18 app and breaks its typecheck.
